rtao-upstream-macros

This package republishes subtensor-macros from RaoFoundation/subtensor v490 so that rtao
(https://github.com/sam0x17/rtao) can be published on crates.io, which does not accept Git
dependencies. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the authors of
subtensor-macros. Report problems with this package to rtao.

